docs {
  `GET /api/v2/inventory/collection/{inventorycollectionid}`

  List the products in an inventory collection that can be bought on a back-office order, priced for the given rep or customer; some of them may not be purchasable online, and OData query options ($filter, $top, $orderby, $select) are supported.

  Required scope: `api/Read`

  Fill in the path parameters on the **Params** tab before sending.

  Optional query parameters are disabled; enable the ones you need on the **Params** tab.
}
